    "pr_comments": [
        "[The new commit](https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/pull/11644/commits/be86415832fd16ffa3d5c64fdc3c7de821181506) made two changes:\r\n- add `func Clone() Postings` to `index.Postings`\r\n- cache sorted postings\r\n\r\nI run the benchmark workload with the following command in Kubernetes:\r\n```\r\nenv GOMAXPROCS=16 go test -v -benchmem -bench=BenchmarkDBQuerier -run=BenchmarkDBQuerier -benchtime=22x -count=10 -timeout=360m | tee /data/$(git branch --show-current | tr '/' '_')@$(git rev-parse --short HEAD).txt\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe benchmark results are much better ([main@6bdecf377](https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/tree/6bdecf377cea8e856509914f35234e948c4fcb80) vs this patch):\r\n```\r\nname                                           old time/op    new time/op    delta\r\nDBQuerier/n=\"1\"-16                               89.0ms \u00b110%    71.3ms \u00b1 4%  -19.84%  (p=0.000 n=10+9)\r\nDBQuerier/n=\"1\",j=\"foo\"-16                       51.1ms \u00b1 7%    38.4ms \u00b1 7%  -24.90%  (p=0.000 n=10+9)\r\nDBQuerier/j=\"foo\",n=\"1\"-16                       51.2ms \u00b1 5%    38.6ms \u00b1 5%  -24.46%  (p=0.000 n=9+9)\r\nDBQuerier/n=\"1\",j!=\"foo\"-16                      51.0ms \u00b111%    38.8ms \u00b1 7%  -24.02%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i=~\".*\"-16                              3.25s \u00b1 3%     2.75s \u00b1 2%  -15.29%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i=~\"1.*\"-16                             374ms \u00b1 5%     309ms \u00b1 7%  -17.54%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i=~\".*1\"-16                            1.08ms \u00b120%    0.51ms \u00b121%  -52.80%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i=~\".+\"-16                              3.48s \u00b1 2%     2.91s \u00b1 2%  -16.60%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i=~\"\"-16                                218ms \u00b115%     119ms \u00b114%  -45.59%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerier/i!=\"\"-16                                3.48s \u00b1 4%     2.88s \u00b1 2%  -17.16%  (p=0.000 n=10+10)\r\nDBQuerie